<!-- The released jawata engine, as Eclipse bundles: spi, core, mcp and catalogue, taken from a released jawata-mcp dist (scripts/fetch-engine.sh,
     engine.version), plus the two libraries Eclipse's own download does not carry that the engine imports: Jackson and H2.
     It holds ONLY released engine bundles and what they need. Never: JDT, LTK, SWT, JFace, an slf4j provider, org.jawata.jdtpatch or
     org.jawata.resident (contract section 9, R8) — Eclipse brings its own, and the resident is the headless host. Plan Stage 15. -->
